! TDDFT mode matrix 11/16 -- spherical-harmonic working basis
!
! With %spherical the SCF works in the nbf_sph basis while the ERI
! store and the AO->MO transform stay Cartesian, so run_tddft takes
! its nmo = mol%nbf_sph branch and the transform must bridge the two.
! STO-3G has no d shells, so the excitation energies should match the
! Cartesian case 05 to print precision -- that equality IS the test.
! (Switch the basis to 6-31G(d) to make the two genuinely differ.)
%method  B3LYP
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%charge  0
%mult    1
%spherical
%tddft   3
%tddft_tda on
%tddft_multiplicity singlet
%geom angstrom
O    0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
H    0.000000    0.757200   -0.469200
H    0.000000   -0.757200   -0.469200
*end
